# Signal Engine (Python)

- Type hints on all public functions; Pydantic for structured data
- Pipeline changes go through LangGraph nodes in `graph/` — not ad-hoc scripts
- LLM calls use `llm/providers.py` (ai-fallback-chain) — never single-provider
- New nodes need tests in `tests/` (TDD)
- Format/lint: ruff, line-length 100
